  "bio": "Max Brain is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Varese, Italy, boasting 15 years of experience in the 'traditional' style. His work is indicative of his philosophy, 'Ancient as Time - Modern as Tomorrow,' reflecting an adept combination of classic concepts with contemporary interpretations. With additional pursuits in painting and building, Max's artistry proves his rich, well-rounded experience in his craft.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Varese, Lombardy, Italy\n\n🇮🇹 17 years of tattoo experience @colorsvarese  \nAncient as Time - Modern as Tomorrow \nPaintings @maxbrainanemoia  \nI build stuff @braindevices",
